{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frenzy Freak Fantasy is a batshit strategy riot where you command fart-flying T-Rexes, AK-47 toilet goblins, crotch-cannon lunatics, and even horse-like weirdos. Fuse units for wacko hybrids, battle on chaotic maps, and unleash absurd attacks in sandbox mode to craft your own bonkers brawls. Expect a few hours of zany single-player chaos, with multiplayer planned, all wrapped in a crude, meme-fueled vibe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>A paradise for horse lovers\uff1a</u>If you love the horse style creature you must love this game</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Fusion Mechanism</u></i></strong>: You can fuse two or more combat units to create a more powerful unit.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/429350b3b473c2a26cc5fbb868b38a16.poster.avif?t=1756997721\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/429350b3b473c2a26cc5fbb868b38a16.webm?t=1756997721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/429350b3b473c2a26cc5fbb868b38a16.mp4?t=1756997721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>High Dynamic Combat:</u>The battlefield is ever-changing and full of artistic atmosphere</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Classic Sandbox Mode:</u>Use your creative brain make your own goon battle until you are happy</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928560?t=175699772